  "content": "<p data-pid=\"gKghF3FF\">……紧接着是两个对特定学术争论进行更深入探讨的系列：<a href=\"https://link.zhihu.com/?target=https%3A//www.readthesequences.com/Physicalism201Sequence\" data-draft-type=\"text-link\" class=\" wrap external\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">​​「物理主义导论」</a>（关于意识的困难问题）和<a href=\"https://link.zhihu.com/?target=https%3A//www.readthesequences.com/QuantumPhysicsAndManyWorldsSequence\" data-draft-type=\"text-link\" class=\" wrap external\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">​​「量子物理与多世界」</a>（关于物理学中的测量问题）。</p><p data-pid=\"B1s4KdJ8\">—Rob Bensinger，<a href=\"https://link.zhihu.com/?target=https%3A//www.readthesequences.com/TheWorldAnIntroduction\" data-draft-type=\"text-link\" class=\" wrap external\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">​​《世界：导读》</a><sup data-text=\"世界：导读\" data-url=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/2064705136883245583\" data-draft-node=\"inline\" data-draft-type=\"reference\" data-numero=\"1\">[1]</sup></p><hr/><a href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/2084282246509360030\" data-draft-node=\"block\" data-draft-type=\"link-card\" data-draft-title=\"手与手指\" data-draft-cover=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/v2-a08ba423db34e806a4aa1ac0e71462a1.jpg?source=7e7ef6e2&amp;needBackground=1\" class=\"internal\">手与手指</a><a href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/2084733379602399938\" data-draft-node=\"block\" data-draft-type=\"link-card\" data-draft-title=\"愤怒的原子\" data-draft-cover=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-b81a8225bc4abdd2751532923277e6cf.jpg?source=7e7ef6e2&amp;needBackground=1\" class=\"internal\">愤怒的原子</a><a href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/2085072185794872242\" data-draft-node=\"block\" data-draft-type=\"link-card\" data-draft-title=\"热与运动\" data-draft-cover=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-d76a30d42dd9d6bd43df526cef4b67a0.jpg?source=7e7ef6e2&amp;needBackground=1\" class=\"internal\">热与运动</a><a href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/2086068175641245227\" data-draft-node=\"block\" data-draft-type=\"link-card\" data-draft-title=\"脑科学惊天突破！大脑竟然是由神经元构成的！\" data-draft-cover=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-211787ec30877c6d28dc424a31b9abcd.jpg?source=7e7ef6e2&amp;needBackground=1\" class=\"internal\">脑科学惊天突破！大脑竟然是由神经元构成的！</a><a href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/2086394609740129305\" data-draft-node=\"block\" data-draft-type=\"link-card\" data-draft-title=\"当拟人化变得愚蠢\" data-draft-cover=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-68d4596a9adad7d020ad13b92983fdc2.jpg?source=7e7ef6e2&amp;needBackground=1\" class=\"internal\">当拟人化变得愚蠢</a><a href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/2086845319023694081\" data-draft-node=\"block\" data-draft-type=\"link-card\" data-draft-title=\"先验\" data-draft-cover=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-409b0c1be43001d0c601d0cf10f7be2a.jpg?source=7e7ef6e2&amp;needBackground=1\" class=\"internal\">先验</a><a href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/2086966654446082033\" data-draft-node=\"block\" data-draft-type=\"link-card\" data-draft-title=\"还原性指代\" data-draft-cover=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-4223fb1a363a31e772c9cd4c2785376a.jpg?source=7e7ef6e2&amp;needBackground=1\" class=\"internal\">还原性指代</a><a href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/2087674441681594268\" data-draft-node=\"block\" data-draft-type=\"link-card\" data-draft-title=\"僵尸！僵尸？\" data-draft-cover=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/v2-b951b69f2ed044b7eb751a20a585469d.webp?source=7e7ef6e2&amp;needBackground=1\" class=\"internal\">僵尸！僵尸？</a><a href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/2091473271388747005\" data-draft-node=\"block\" data-draft-type=\"link-card\" data-draft-title=\"僵尸评论的回应\" data-draft-cover=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-b136613023d378147bcd56715709909d.png?source=7e7ef6e2&amp;needBackground=1\" class=\"internal\">僵尸评论的回应</a><a href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/2091826482167522750\" data-draft-node=\"block\" data-draft-type=\"link-card\" data-draft-title=\"广义反僵尸原则\" data-draft-cover=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-20c22bb52d099287186ef62267e7fc22.jpg?source=7e7ef6e2&amp;needBackground=1\" class=\"internal\">广义反僵尸原则</a><a href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/2092215701784286345\" data-draft-node=\"block\" data-draft-type=\"link-card\" data-draft-title=\"广义反僵尸原则与巨型查找表\" data-draft-cover=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-f223486874981e2afb5261b5b90873e7.png?source=7e7ef6e2&amp;needBackground=1\" class=\"internal\">广义反僵尸原则与巨型查找表</a><a href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/2092664126510216396\" data-draft-node=\"block\" data-draft-type=\"link-card\" data-draft-title=\"相信必然蕴含的不可见事物\" data-draft-cover=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-905547de67a80bf87d9fd48fb4d2eddd.jpg?source=7e7ef6e2&amp;needBackground=1\" class=\"internal\">相信必然蕴含的不可见事物</a><a href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/2092983805338445643\" data-draft-node=\"block\" data-draft-type=\"link-card\" data-draft-title=\"僵尸大电影\" data-draft-cover=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-55448c1cadf521d7202f95ca56e83caf.jpg?source=7e7ef6e2&amp;needBackground=1\" class=\"internal\">僵尸大电影</a><a href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/2093350438557040811\" data-draft-node=\"block\" data-draft-type=\"link-card\" data-draft-title=\"排除超自然\" data-draft-cover=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-820df62aaf8bbbc8d06637c7f97a63a2.jpg?source=7e7ef6e2&amp;needBackground=1\" class=\"internal\">排除超自然</a><a href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/2093705279259131933\" data-draft-node=\"block\" data-draft-type=\"link-card\" data-draft-title=\"灵能/特异功能\" data-draft-cover=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-73ae6766f2963a2a7604c3e9449cba0e.jpg?source=7e7ef6e2&amp;needBackground=1\" class=\"internal\">灵能/特异功能</a><hr/><p data-pid=\"FcMm1Y-_\">总目录：</p><a href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/2056344770390373406\" data-draft-node=\"block\" data-draft-type=\"link-card\" data-draft-title=\"《理性：从人工智能到僵尸》导读与目录\" data-draft-cover=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-3fef08abf83e7421c313574aac5dde16.png?source=7e7ef6e2&amp;needBackground=1\" class=\"internal\">《理性：从人工智能到僵尸》导读与目录</a><p data-pid=\"CQ6oFMJf\">卷：</p><a href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/2064365098970436713\" data-draft-node=\"block\" data-draft-type=\"link-card\" data-draft-title=\"第四卷：区区现实\" data-draft-cover=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/v2-28e9661e962caec2608202b8f2662d4d.jpg?source=7e7ef6e2&amp;needBackground=1\" class=\"internal\">第四卷：区区现实</a><p data-pid=\"9n4q5DQu\">上一篇：</p><a href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/2083224426108274393\" data-draft-node=\"block\" data-draft-type=\"link-card\" data-draft-title=\"入会仪式\" data-draft-cover=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-6e3fd1c3e88fedc23c4db3ef71f18e61.jpg?source=7e7ef6e2&amp;needBackground=1\" class=\"internal\">入会仪式</a><p data-pid=\"fUZBWPQO\">下一篇：</p><a href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/2084282246509360030\" data-draft-node=\"block\" data-draft-type=\"link-card\" data-draft-title=\"手与手指\" data-draft-cover=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-a08ba423db34e806a4aa1ac0e71462a1.jpg?source=7e7ef6e2&amp;needBackground=1\" class=\"internal\">手与手指</a><hr/><blockquote data-pid=\"GdZaEsBs\"><a href=\"https://link.zhihu.com/?target=http%3A//paratranz.cn/projects/3131\" data-draft-type=\"text-link\" class=\" wrap external\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">Thoughts Memo</a> 汉化组译制<br/>原文：<a href=\"https://link.zhihu.com/?target=https%3A//www.readthesequences.com/Physicalism-201-Sequence\" data-draft-type=\"text-link\" class=\" wrap external\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">Physicalism 201 - Sequence</a></blockquote>",
